# Generated per run, never committed.
#
# fixtures/ holds live access tokens for the throwaway @loadtest.local
# users plus the fraud-rule restore point; results/ holds whatever the
# last run produced. Both are reproducible from `lt setup` and a k6 run,
# and the numbers that are worth keeping live in the README instead —
# committing a results directory would mean the repository slowly filling
# with the output of every experiment anyone ever ran.
fixtures/
results/
